#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000036
msgid "Lightweight pump-action shotgun. Equipped with scope. Combines the features of a shotgun with added range."
msgstr "轻型泵动霰弹枪。配有瞄准镜。兼具霰弹枪特性与更远射程。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000037
msgid "Automatic shotgun. Holds six rounds. Its rapid-fire capability brings immense  firepower, but it is difficult to handle."
msgstr "自动霰弹枪。可装六发。连射火力强大，但难以操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000038
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000039
msgid "Automatic shotgun. Modified to hold eight rounds. Its rapid-fire capability brings immense firepower, but it is difficult to handle."
msgstr "自动霰弹枪。改装后可装八发。连射火力强大，但难以操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00003a
msgid "Prototype full-auto shotgun. Its outstanding capacity and firing speed make it the most powerful shotgun in the world."
msgstr "试作型全自动霰弹枪。出色的装弹量与射速使其成为世上最强的霰弹枪。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00003d
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but it is both easy to handle and accurate."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但易于操控且精准。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00003e
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but the addition of a grip increases accuracy."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但加装握把提升了精准度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00003f
msgid "Large-caliber submachine gun. Requires both hands to use, preventing the use of a shield, but the addition of a grip increases accuracy. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "大口径冲锋枪。需双手持用，无法同时使用盾牌，但加装握把提升了精准度。弹匣容量增加。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000040
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy, but it suffers from low accuracy."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。高射速能有效压制敌人，但精准度较低。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000041
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy, but it suffers from low accuracy. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。高射速能有效压制敌人，但精准度较低。配有消音器。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000042
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Its high firing speed makes it effective at stopping the enemy. The barrel jacket increases accuracy."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。高射速能有效压制敌人。枪管护套提升了精准度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000043
msgid "High-precision submachine gun. Possessing the same firing mechanism as an assault rifle, it is the most accurate submachine gun in the world."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪。采用与突击步枪相同的击发机构，是世上最精准的冲锋枪。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000044
msgid "High-precision submachine gun. Possessing the same firing mechanism as an assault rifle, it is the most accurate submachine gun in the world. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪。采用与突击步枪相同的击发机构，是世上最精准的冲锋枪。配有消音器。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000045
msgid "High-precision submachine gun, the most accurate in the world. Its built-in suppressor ensures a continuous silencing effect."
msgstr "高精度冲锋枪，世上最精准。内置消音器可持续消音。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000046
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Has low recoil and wide AUTO AIM range, but low shot-for-shot power as well."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。后坐力小、自动瞄准范围广，但单发威力也低。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000047
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000048
msgid "Compact, lightweight submachine gun. Has low recoil and wide AUTO AIM range, but low shot-for-shot power as well. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。后坐力小、自动瞄准范围广，但单发威力也低。配有消音器。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00004b
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000231
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000232
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000233
msgid ""
"Compact & lightweight submachine gun.\n"
"Press the Attack Button while \n"
"holding the Aim Button to fire. "
msgstr "紧凑轻便的冲锋枪。\n按住瞄准键时\n按下攻击键即可开火。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00004c
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00004d
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Highly accurate and can be equipped with a variety of parts through R&D."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。精准度高，可通过研发加装多种配件。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00004e
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Combines its high accuracy with a suppressor, increasing its usefulness in covert operations."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。高精准度结合消音器，提升了隐秘行动的实用性。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00004f
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with shotgun. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有霰弹枪。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000050
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005b
msgid "Large-frame assault pistol modified from an M16. Though it has intense recoil and is difficult to handle, it possesses unlimited ammo."
msgstr "由M16改装的大口径突击手枪。后坐力强、难以操控，但弹药无限。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000051
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with shotgun and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有霰弹枪与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000052
msgid "M16a1_A(Shotgun)"
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000053
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有榴弹发射器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000054
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000055
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with grenade launcher and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有榴弹发射器与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000056
msgid "M16a1_B(Grenader) "
msgstr ""

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000057
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有烟雾弹发射器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000058
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000059
msgid "New-model, lightweight assault rifle. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher and laser sight. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "新型轻量突击步枪。配有烟雾弹发射器与激光瞄准器。用R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005a
msgid "M16a1_C(Smoke Grenader)"
msgstr "M16a1_C(烟雾榴弹)"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005c
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Highly accurate and easy to handle. Can be equipped with a variety of parts through R&D."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。精度高、易操作。可通过研发加装多种配件。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005d
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Highly accurate and easy to handle. Equipped with suppressor through R&D."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。精度高、易操作。已通过研发加装消音器。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00005f
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000060
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000061
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with underbarrel shotgun. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备下挂式霰弹枪。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000062
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000063
msgid "Compact, lightweight carbine. Outfitted with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "紧凑轻便的卡宾枪。配备烟雾榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000064
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Its massive firepower is effective at stopping the enemy, but its strong recoil reduces accuracy."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。强大火力能有效压制敌人，但后坐力大、精度下降。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000065
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Equipped with grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。配备榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000066
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006a
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006b
msgid "Romanian assault rifle. Equipped with a recoil buffer on the stock, maintaining its power while reducing recoil."
msgstr "罗马尼亚突击步枪。枪托装有缓冲器，保持威力的同时减小后坐力。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000067
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000068
msgid "Soviet assault rifle. Equipped with smoke grenade launcher. Switch with the R button (for hunter control type, press <I=RIGH>)."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪。配备烟雾榴弹发射器。按R键切换（猎人操作模式按<I=RIGH>）。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000069
msgid "Romanian assault rifle. Very powerful, but has strong recoil. Equipped with foregrip, increasing accuracy."
msgstr "罗马尼亚突击步枪。威力强大但后坐力大。配备前握把，提升精度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006c
msgid "Soviet light machine gun. The long barrel means low recoil, but it is difficult to handle. Its powerful rounds are effective at stopping the enemy."
msgstr "苏联轻机枪。长枪管后坐力小，但难以操控。强力弹药能有效压制敌人。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006d
msgid "Soviet light machine gun. The long barrel means low recoil, but it is difficult to handle. Its powerful rounds are effective at stopping the enemy. Increased mag capacity."
msgstr "苏联轻机枪。长枪管后坐力小，但难以操控。强力弹药能有效压制敌人。弹容量增加。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006e
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Difficult to handle but powerful. Has wide AUTO AIM range."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。难以操控但威力强大。自动瞄准范围广。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00006f
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Powerful, with wide AUTO AIM range. The shorter barrel makes it easier to handle."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。威力强大，自动瞄准范围广。枪管较短，更易操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000070
msgid "Large-caliber assault rifle. Powerful, with a wide AUTO AIM range. The laser sight enables easier targeting."
msgstr "大口径突击步枪。威力强大，自动瞄准范围广。激光瞄准器更易锁定目标。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000071
msgid "Bullpup assault rifle. While only moderately powerful, it is compact and easy to handle, with low recoil as well."
msgstr "无托突击步枪。威力一般，但紧凑易操控，后坐力也小。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000072
msgid "Prototype caseless assault rifle. Though its low recoil ammo enables easier targeting, it lacks power."
msgstr "无壳弹突击步枪原型。低后坐力弹药更易瞄准，但威力不足。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000073
msgid "A musket. When this gun hits its target, mysterious things may happen from time to time."
msgstr "火枪。当此枪命中目标时，偶尔会发生怪事。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000081
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000082
msgid ""
"Compact & lightweight assault rifle.\n"
"Press the Attack Button while \n"
"holding the Aim Button to fire. "
msgstr "紧凑轻便的突击步枪。\n按住瞄准键时\n按下攻击键即可开火。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000089
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Has a large capacity and can maintain high firepower, but its weight makes it hard to handle."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。弹容量大、可持续输出火力，但重量大难以操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008a
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Though still heavy and hard to handle, its use of armor piercing also makes it an effective weapon against armored vehicles."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。依然沉重难操控，但使用穿甲弹，对装甲车也有效。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008b
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008c
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. A high capacity of armor piercing rounds maintains its firepower, and a shorter barrel makes it easier to handle."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。大容量穿甲弹维持火力，枪管较短更易操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008d
msgid "Lightweight light machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds, a big advantage against armored vehicles. The lightest machine gun in the world, making it easy to handle."
msgstr "轻型轻机枪。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车有巨大优势。世界最轻的机枪，易于操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00008f
msgid "Lightweight light machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds. The lightest machine gun in the world, making it easy to handle. The shorter barrel further improves handling."
msgstr "轻型轻机枪。使用穿甲弹。世界最轻的机枪，易于操控。枪管较短，操控性进一步提升。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000090
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Capacity can be increased."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。可扩充容量。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000091
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000092
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。弹匣容量已扩充。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000093
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, but it is difficult to handle. Highest capacity among machine guns."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，但较难操控。机枪中容量最大。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000094
msgid "Soviet general purpose machine gun. Its high capacity allows it to maintain high firepower, and it is easier to handle with its shorter barrel."
msgstr "苏联通用机枪。大容量使其能持续输出高火力，枪管较短更易操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000095
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Its extremely fast firing speed gives it great power, but strong recoil makes it hard to control."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。射速极快，威力巨大，但后坐力强难以控制。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000096
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Fast firing but strong recoil. Uses armor piercing rounds, which are effective against armored vehicles."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。射速快但后坐力强。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车有效。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000097
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000098
msgid "Large-caliber general purpose machine gun. Uses armor piercing rounds. Its extremely fast firing speed gives it great power, but strong recoil makes it hard to control. Increased mag capacity."
msgstr "大口径通用机枪。使用穿甲弹。射速极快，威力巨大，但后坐力强难以控制。弹匣容量已扩充。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000099
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00009b
msgid "Gatling machine gun. Its high firing speed well exceeds that of normal machine guns, but it is also heavier and harder to use."
msgstr "加特林机枪。射速远超普通机枪，但更重也更难使用。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00009a
msgid "Special gun that crosses multiple EM waves to concentrate a mass of energy in one spot. Requires a CO-OPS teammate to produce the necessary interference."
msgstr "特殊枪械，可交叉多道电磁波将能量集中于一点。需合作任务队友制造必要的干扰。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00009c
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000237
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000238
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000239
msgid ""
"Large-bore general purpose machine gun\n"
"Press the Attack Button while \n"
"holding the Aim Button to fire. "
msgstr "大口径通用机枪\n按住瞄准键的同时\n按下攻击键即可开火。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00009f
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, its rapid fire capability allows for quick follow-up shots. Zoom can be adjusted. "
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快可迅速补射。可调整倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a0
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, it is capable of rapid fire and offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快，具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a1
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a2
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. While not the most accurate, it is capable of rapid fire. Uses PSYCHE Recovery Rounds. Offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。精度不算最高，但射速快。使用精神恢复弹。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a3
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds effective against vehicles. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Offers 3 levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用对车辆有效的穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a4
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Easier to handle with its shorter barrel."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。枪管较短更易操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a5
msgid "Large-caliber, automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Boasts high capacity, rapid fire, and high accuracy. Equipped with suppressor."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹。容量大、射速快、精度高。配备消音器。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a6
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds, resulting in devastating power even against armored vehicles. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，对装甲车也能造成毁灭性威力。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a7
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a8
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds, resulting in devastating power. The bull barrel helps reduce muzzle jump."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，威力毁灭性。重型枪管有助于减少枪口上跳。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000a9
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000aa
msgid "High-precision, bolt-action sniper rifle. Uses LIFE Recovery Rounds. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "高精度栓动狙击步枪。使用生命值恢复弹。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ab
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. Can knock enemies out from a distance, but its bolt-action design does not allow for rapid fire. Zoom can be adjusted. "
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。可远距离击晕敌人，但栓动设计无法快速连射。可调整倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ac
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. Can knock enemies out from a distance, but its bolt-action design does not allow for rapid fire. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。可远距离击晕敌人，但栓动设计无法快速连射。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ad
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ae
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. The skeleton stock results in a reduced weight."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。骨架枪托减轻了重量。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000af
msgid "Tranquilizer sniper rifle. The suppressor provides an additional edge in long-range combat."
msgstr "麻醉狙击步枪。消音器为远距离战斗增添优势。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b0
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Its armor piercing bullets will penetrate helmets. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。穿甲弹可击穿头盔。具备3级倍率。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b1
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets for effective resistance against armored vehicles and is  relatively easy to handle."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，能有效对抗装甲车，且相对易于操控。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b2
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets and is relatively easy to handle. Increased magazine capacity."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，较易操控。弹匣容量增加。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b3
msgid "Soviet large-caliber automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing bullets and is relatively easy to handle. The night-vision sight supports combat in the dark."
msgstr "苏联大口径自动狙击步枪。使用穿甲弹，较易操控。夜视瞄准镜支持夜间作战。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b4
msgid "Prototype bullpup automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds that can pierce even the thickest plating. Hard to handle but extremely accurate."
msgstr "无托式自动狙击步枪原型。使用穿甲弹，可击穿最厚的装甲。难以操控但精度极高。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b5
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b6
msgid "Prototype bullpup automatic sniper rifle. Uses armor piercing rounds. Hard to handle but extremely accurate. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "无托式自动狙击步枪原型。使用穿甲弹。难以操控但精度极高。提供三级变焦。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b7
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b8
msgid "Large-caliber anti-tank rifle. Single-shot. Offers three levels of zoom. Its massive power easily tears through even thick metal."
msgstr "大口径反坦克步枪。单发。提供三级变焦。其巨大威力可轻易击穿厚金属。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000b9
msgid "Large-caliber anti-tank rifle. Rapid-fire. Delivers an intense barrage of highly penetrating anti-tank rounds. Offers three levels of zoom."
msgstr "大口径反坦克步枪。速射。可倾泻密集的高穿透反坦克弹幕。提供三级变焦。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ba
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000bb
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000bc
msgid "Electromagnetic projectile acceleration system. Extremely powerful, but uses a lot of electricity.  Using an electrical supply from a CO-OPS teammate is ideal."
msgstr "电磁投射加速系统。威力极强，但耗电量大。最好由合作任务队友供电。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000bd
msgid "Railgun remote charging system. Supplies electricity to a CO-OPS teammate's railgun after locking onto it. Press <I=ATK> repeatedly to increase output."
msgstr "轨道枪远程充电系统。锁定合作任务队友的轨道枪后为其供电。反复按<I=ATK>提高输出。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000cb
msgid ""
"Large-bore automatic sniper rifle. \n"
"Hold Aim Button for over-the-shoulder view\n"
"and press the Attack Button to fire.\n"
"Scope view is adjustable."
msgstr "大口径自动狙击步枪。\n按住瞄准键进入越肩视角\n按攻击键开火。\n瞄准镜视野可调。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000cc
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000cd
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ce
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000cf
msgid "Disposable rocket launcher. Compact and light, making it possible to carry several at once. A downside is its weak power."
msgstr "一次性火箭筒。小巧轻便，可同时携带数具。缺点是威力较弱。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d0
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d1
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d2
msgid "Four-round rocket launcher. Not that powerful round-for-round, but is capable of rapid fire. Has high overall firepower that can be unleashed in an instant."
msgstr "四发火箭筒。单发威力不强，但可速射。总火力高，可瞬间倾泻。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d3
msgid "Rocket-propelled grenade launcher. While not very accurate, it is powerful and it is easy to carry a relatively large number of rounds for it."
msgstr "火箭推进榴弹发射器。精度不高，但威力强大，且弹药较易大量携带。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d4
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d5
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d6
msgid "New-model rocket-propelled grenade launcher. Powerful and has easy-to-carry rounds. Though not that accurate, its scope enables easier targeting."
msgstr "新型火箭推进榴弹发射器。威力强大，弹药易携带。精度不高，但瞄准镜便于瞄准。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d7
msgid "Portable surface-to-air missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets, so it is effective at attacking moving enemies. Lock-on can be upgraded."
msgstr "便携式地对空导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标，对移动敌人有效。锁定性能可升级。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d8
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000d9
msgid "New-model portable surface-to-air missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets, so it is effective at attacking moving enemies. Lock-on can be upgraded."
msgstr "新型便携式地对空导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标，对移动敌人有效。锁定性能可升级。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000da
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000db
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000dc
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000dd
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle. Has high initial shell velocity and accuracy, but takes a bit of time to reload."
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。炮弹初速与精度高，但装填需一些时间。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000de
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000df
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e0
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle. Has high initial shell velocity and accuracy. Uses HEAT rounds. This gives it wider damage radius but slightly less power."
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。炮弹初速与精度高。使用破甲弹。伤害范围更广但威力略低。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e1
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e2
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e3
msgid "Portable recoilless rifle.  Uses Fulton recovery rounds. Connecting with a target will execute a Fulton recovery. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "便携式无后坐力炮。使用富尔顿回收弹。命中目标即执行富尔顿回收。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e4
msgid "Portable anti-tank missile. Will automatically follow locked-on targets. Its powerful warhead makes it an extremely valuable asset in ground-to-ground combat."
msgstr "便携式反坦克导弹。会自动追踪锁定的目标。强力弹头使其在地对地战斗中极为宝贵。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e5
msgid "Special gun that renders its target optically invisible. Use it to hide your CO-OPS teammates. Runs on batteries."
msgstr "使目标光学隐形的特殊枪械。用于隐藏你的合作任务队友。使用电池。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e6
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e7
msgid "Special gun that renders its target optically invisible. Use it to hide your CO-OPS teammates. Increased battery size allows for extended use."
msgstr "使目标光学隐形的特殊枪械。用于隐藏你的合作任务队友。电池容量增加，可延长使用时间。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e8
msgid "4 player CO-OPS weapon. 2 posts and 1 band are required. The fourth person is the human bullet. Multiple posts can be equipped."
msgstr "4人合作任务武器。需要2根立柱和1条弹力带。第四人即人体炮弹。可装备多根立柱。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000e9
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ea
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000eb
msgid "With all players CO-OP In, set posts and band together, and then have the human bullet press <I=ACT>. Tap <I=ATK> to build up power. Can't be used alone as a weapon."
msgstr "所有玩家进入合作后，一起设置立柱和弹力带，然后由人体炮弹按<I=ACT>。连按<I=ATK>蓄力。无法单独作为武器使用。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000f7
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000242
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000243
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000244
msgid ""
"Rocket-propelled grenade launcher.\n"
"Hold Aim Button for over-the-shoulder view\n"
"and press the Attack Button to fire."
msgstr "火箭推进榴弹发射器。\n按住瞄准键进入越肩视角\n按攻击键开火。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000f8
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000f9
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000fa
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000fb
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000fc
msgid "Fragmentation grenade. Unleashes explosion over a wide radius. R&D can increase power."
msgstr "破片手雷。爆炸范围广。研发可提升威力。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000fd
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000fe
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x0000ff
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000100
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000101
msgid "Sound and flash grenade. Non-lethal. Will knock enemy soldiers unconscious. R&D can increase power and blast radius."
msgstr "音爆闪光弹。非致命。可使敌兵昏迷。研发可提升威力与爆炸范围。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000102
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000103
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000104
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000105
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000106
msgid "Electronic scrambling grenade. Non-lethal. Temporarily prevents electronic equipment from functioning correctly. R&D can extend length of effect."
msgstr "电子干扰弹。非致命。可暂时使电子设备失灵。研发可延长效果时间。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000107
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000108
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000109
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010a
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010b
msgid "Smoke-producing grenade. Non-lethal. Smoke will obstruct enemy vision and temporarily hinder movement. R&D can increase time smoke is emitted. "
msgstr "发烟手雷。非致命。烟雾可遮挡敌人视线并暂时妨碍移动。研发可延长发烟时间。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010c
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010d
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00010f
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000110
msgid "Colored smoke-producing grenade. Non-lethal. Smoke will obstruct enemy vision and temporarily hinder movement. R&D can increase time smoke is emitted. "
msgstr "彩色发烟手雷。非致命。烟雾可遮挡敌人视线并暂时妨碍移动。研发可延长发烟时间。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000111
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000112
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000113
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000114
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000115
msgid "Sleep gas grenade. Non-lethal. Emits a gas that induces sleep if inhaled. R&D can strengthen its effect."
msgstr "催眠瓦斯弹。非致命。释放吸入后令人昏睡的气体。研发可增强效果。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000116
msgid "Empty gun magazine. Non-lethal. The noise it makes when thrown can be used to distract enemies."
msgstr "空弹匣。非致命。投掷时的声响可用来引开敌人。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000117
msgid "Support supply request marker that is thrown. After throwing, press <I=HHA> to receive ammo and items. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "投掷式支援补给请求标记。投出后按<I=HHA>可获得弹药与道具。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000118
msgid "Support strike request marker that is thrown. After throwing, press <I=HHA> to execute strike. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "投掷式支援攻击请求标记。投出后按<I=HHA>发动攻击。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000119
msgid "Throw to release the net, and then press <I=HHA> to activate it. When a vehicle gets caught, flip the switches on the 4 devices to capture it."
msgstr "投出后展开网，再按<I=HHA>启动。车辆被网住后，扳动4个装置上的开关即可捕获。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011a
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011b
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011c
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011d
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011e
msgid "Plastic explosive. Face location to be set, ready C4, then press <I=ATK> to set. After setting, press <I=HHA> at any time to detonate. R&D can increase power."
msgstr "塑胶炸药。面向设置位置，准备好C4后按<I=ATK>设置。设置后随时按<I=HHA>引爆。研发可提升威力。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00011f
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000120
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000121
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000122
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000123
msgid "Directional, anti-personnel landmine. Face location to be set, ready, then press <I=ATK> to set. R&D can increase power."
msgstr "定向反步兵地雷。面向设置位置，准备好后按<I=ATK>设置。研发可提升威力。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000124
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000125
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000126
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000127
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000128
msgid "A popular magazine. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it. The more issues set, the longer the person will be interested."
msgstr "热门杂志。设置后，注意到的人会停下阅读。设置的数量越多，阅读时间越长。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00012e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00012f
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000130
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000131
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000132
msgid "The pages are ingrained with the scent of countless delicacies, sending nearby wildlife into a trance."
msgstr "书页浸透了无数美食的香气，能让附近的野生动物神魂颠倒。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000133
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000134
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000135
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000137
msgid "A popular pulp magazine. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it! Face location to be set, ready, then press <I=ATK> to set. "
msgstr "热门廉价杂志。设置后，注意到的人会停下阅读！面向设置位置，准备好后按<I=ATK>设置。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000136
msgid "A magazine loaded with pictures of beautiful women. Once set, anyone who notices it will stop to read it! Face location to be set, ready, then press <I=ATK> to set. "
msgstr "印满美女照片的杂志。设置后，注意到的人会停下阅读！面向设置位置，准备好后按<I=ATK>设置。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000138
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000139
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013a
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013b
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013c
msgid "Anti-ground vehicle landmine. Not effective against air vehicles. Renders vehicles temporarily immobile."
msgstr "反地面车辆地雷。对空中载具无效。可使车辆暂时无法移动。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013d
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00013f
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000140
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000141
msgid "Wooden human decoy designed to fool enemy soldiers. To use, first set, then press <I=HHA> to activate. R&D can increase strength and allow it to be used as cover."
msgstr "用来迷惑敌兵的木制假人。使用时先设置，再按<I=HHA>启动。研发可提升强度并使其可用作掩体。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000142
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000143
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000144
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000145
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000146
msgid "Aerial (vehicle) mine. Automatically rises once set, rendering vehicles temporarily immobile if hit."
msgstr "对空（载具）地雷。设置后会自动升起，命中可使车辆暂时无法移动。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000148
msgid "Sleeping gas mine with Fulton recovery capability. Automatically executes Fulton recovery on targets after they fall asleep. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "带富尔顿回收功能的催眠瓦斯地雷。目标昏睡后自动执行富尔顿回收。（每次任务最多可回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x000149
msgid "Support supply request marker that is set. Once set, press <I=HHA> to receive ammo and items. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "设置式支援补给请求标记。设置后按<I=HHA>可获得弹药与道具。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014a
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014b
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014c
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014d
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014e
#: slot/0x0052e4f8/0x594864/0x00014f
msgid "Support strike request marker that is set. Once set, press <I=HHA> to execute strike. Heroism decreases with overuse."
msgstr "设置式支援攻击请求标记。设置后按<I=HHA>发动攻击。过度使用会降低英雄度。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00003f
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000040
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000041
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000042
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000043
msgid "Meal, Ready-to-Eat. Recovers LIFE. Select from Equipment window and press <I=USE> to use. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "即食口粮。恢复生命值。在装备窗口选择后按<I=USE>使用。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000044
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000045
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000046
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000047
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. Updated with enhanced flavor thanks to the latest in food technology."
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。借助最新食品技术，风味更佳。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000048
msgid "Popular food in Japan. Spicy and delicious. Recovers LIFE. The next generation of food R&D  - truly a taste of the future!"
msgstr "日本热门食物。香辣美味。恢复生命值。新一代食品研发——真正的未来之味！"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000049
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004a
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004b
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004c
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004d
msgid "Military battery. Recharges all item battery gauges. Currently recharging..."
msgstr "军用电池。为所有道具电池槽充电。正在充电……"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004e
msgid "Recovers PSYCHE with its alluring fragrance while keeping you at the top of your game."
msgstr "以迷人香气恢复精神，同时让你保持最佳状态。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00004f
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000050
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000051
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000052
msgid "Take your favorite tunes with you wherever you go! Press <I=STA> to access the Controls Menu. (Cannot be used in VERSUS OPS.)"
msgstr "随身携带你喜欢的音乐！按<I=STA>进入控制菜单。（无法在对战任务中使用。）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000053
msgid "Huey's letter to Strangelove entrusted to Snake. He made it clear he didn't want it to be read..."
msgstr "休伊托SNAKE转交斯特兰奇洛夫的信。他明确表示不希望这封信被阅读……"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000054
msgid "Jigsaw made of steel wire. Alternate pressing the L and R buttons to use."
msgstr "钢丝拼图。交替按L和R键使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000055
msgid "ID card stolen from Strangelove. Appears to open locks inside the prison, but which ones is unclear."
msgstr "从斯特兰奇洛夫偷来的ID卡。似能开监狱内的锁，但具体哪些不明。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000056
msgid "ID card received from Huey. Enables access to Strangelove's lab."
msgstr "从休伊处收到的ID卡。可进入斯特兰奇洛夫的实验室。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000057
msgid "High-quality rangefinder camera. Equip to look through rangefinder, then press <I=ATK> to press shutter button. Photos taken can be viewed from the XMB<I=TM>."
msgstr "高品质测距相机。装备后通过测距仪观察，按<I=ATK>按下快门。拍摄的照片可从XMB<I=TM>查看。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000058
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. When equipped it will display various information on nearby enemies. Invaluable tool for executing missions."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。装备后会显示附近敌人的各种信息。执行任务的必备工具。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000059
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005a
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range, speed, and accuracy of analysis."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。经过改造，提升了搜索范围、速度和分析精度。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005b
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies. Modified to improve search range and speed."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。经过改造，提升了搜索范围和速度。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005c
msgid "Device that analyzes information about enemies.  Even when unequipped, you can still gather info on enemy machinery and higher-ranking soldiers by pressing <I=STA>."
msgstr "分析敌方信息的装置。即使未装备，按<I=STA>仍可收集敌方机械和高级士兵的信息。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005e
msgid "Special, disposable mat that renders you or a teammate invisible when prone or against a wall. To use on a teammate, press <I=ACT> next to them when the icon is displayed."
msgstr "特殊一次性垫子，趴下或靠墙时可使自己或队友隐形。对队友使用时，在图标显示时于其旁边按<I=ACT>。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00005f
msgid "Special camouflage that makes its user invisible when equipped."
msgstr "特殊迷彩，装备后可使使用者隐形。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000060
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Might be able to fit two people. Select from the Equipment window and press the L button to \"DROP\" in order to set (for hunter control type, press <I=LEFT>)."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。也许能装下两个人。在装备窗口选择后按L键“放下”来设置（猎人控制模式下按<I=LEFT>）。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000061
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000062
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000063
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000064
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Might be able to fit two people. Modified to improve durability.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。也许能装两人。改造后更耐用。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000065
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000066
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000067
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000068
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000069
msgid "A bigger cardboard box. Two people may be able to fit in."
msgstr "更大的纸箱。也许能装下两个人。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006a
msgid "Combat-ready love box. Player 1 serves as driver, Player 2 as gunner. Press <I=AIM> to go into first person view and <I=ATK> to fire. \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱。玩家1为驾驶员，玩家2为枪手。按<I=AIM>进入第一人称视角，按<I=ATK>开火。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006b
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006c
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006e
msgid "Combat-ready love box. Modified to improve durability.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱。改造后更耐用。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00006f
msgid "Combat-ready love box. Player 1 serves as driver, Player 2 as gunner. Press <I=AIM> to go into first person view and <I=ATK> to fire stun shells.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱。玩家1为驾驶员，玩家2为枪手。按<I=AIM>进入第一人称视角，按<I=ATK>发射眩晕弹。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000070
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000071
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000072
msgid "Combat-ready love box (equipped with stun cannon). Modified to improve durability.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱（配眩晕炮）。改造后更耐用。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000073
msgid "Combat-ready love box. Player 1 serves as driver, Player 2 as gunner. Press <I=AIM> to go into first person view and <I=ATK> to fire smoke shells.  \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱。玩家1为驾驶员，玩家2为枪手。按<I=AIM>进入第一人称视角，按<I=ATK>发射烟雾弹。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000074
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000075
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000076
msgid "Combat-ready love box (equipped with smoke shells). Modified to improve durability. \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "战斗用爱之箱（配烟雾弹）。改造后更耐用。“放下”来设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000077
msgid "Electronic optical device that detects heat sources, enabling vision in the dark. Can be used simultaneously with weapons."
msgstr "探测热源的电子光学装置，可在黑暗中视物。可与武器同时使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000078
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000079
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007a
msgid "Electronic optical device that detects heat sources, enabling vision in the dark. Modified to improve performance. Battery life has also been extended."
msgstr "探测热源的电子光学装置，可在黑暗中视物。经过改造，提升了性能。电池寿命也延长了。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007b
msgid "Electronic optical device that detects heat sources, enabling vision in the dark. Modified to consume virtually no battery power."
msgstr "探测热源、可在黑暗中视物的电子光学设备。经改造后几乎不耗电。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007c
msgid "Personnel recovery and evacuation system. Equip and move near desired target, then press <I=ACT> to execute recovery. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "人员回收撤离系统。装备后靠近目标，按<I=ACT>执行回收。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007e
msgid "Personnel recovery and evacuation system. Modified so that more can be carried. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "人员回收撤离系统。经改造可搭载更多人。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00007f
msgid "Personnel recovery and evacuation system. Modified so that more can be carried and so that you acquire 1 item when performing a recovery. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "人员回收撤离系统。经改造可搭载更多人，且回收时获得1件物品。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000080
msgid "Personnel recovery and evacuation system. Modified so that more can be carried and so that you acquire 2 items when performing a recovery. (A maximum of 100 people can be recovered per mission)"
msgstr "人员回收撤离系统。经改造可搭载更多人，且回收时获得2件物品。（每次任务最多回收100人）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000081
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material. Press the Aim Button to use. The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾牌。按瞄准键使用。防护方向随所装备武器变化。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000082
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000083
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000084
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000085
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material. Modified to improve durability."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾牌。经改造提升了耐久度。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000086
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material (colored). Press the Aim Button to use. The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾牌（彩色）。按瞄准键使用。防护方向随所装备武器变化。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000087
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000088
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000089
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008a
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material (colored). Modified to improve durability."
msgstr "防弹材料制成的盾牌（彩色）。经改造提升了耐久度。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008b
msgid "Military binoculars for long-distance surveillance and scouting. Equip to use. Zoom can be adjusted. Cannot be used with weapons."
msgstr "用于远距离监视与侦察的军用望远镜。装备后使用。可调节倍率。无法与武器同时使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008c
msgid "Special bandana that supplies an endless amount of ammo while equipped."
msgstr "装备后可无限供应弹药的特殊头巾。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008f
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x00008d
msgid "Shotgun ammo."
msgstr "霰弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00008e
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x00008e
msgid "Anti-tank rifle ammo."
msgstr "反坦克枪弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000090
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009b
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x000090
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x00009b
msgid "Submachine gun ammo."
msgstr "冲锋枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000091
msgid "High-power revolver ammo."
msgstr "大威力左轮弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000092
msgid "Caseless rifle ammo."
msgstr "无壳步枪弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000093
msgid "Grenade launcher ammo. American-made."
msgstr "榴弹发射器弹药。美制。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000094
msgid "Grenade launcher ammo. Soviet-made."
msgstr "榴弹发射器弹药。苏制。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000095
msgid "Large-frame pistol and submachine gun ammo."
msgstr "大口径手枪与冲锋枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000096
msgid "Small-caliber assault rifle ammo."
msgstr "小口径突击步枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000097
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x000097
msgid "Soviet assault rifle ammo."
msgstr "苏联突击步枪弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000098
msgid "Large-caliber rifle and machine gun ammo."
msgstr "大口径步枪与机枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000099
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x87fd33/0x000099
msgid "Soviet rifle and machine gun ammo."
msgstr "苏联步枪与机枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009a
msgid "High-power large-caliber rifle ammo."
msgstr "大威力大口径步枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009c
msgid "Soviet pistol ammo."
msgstr "苏联手枪弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009d
msgid "Small high-explosive anti-tank ammo."
msgstr "小型反坦克高爆弹。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009e
msgid "Special ammo that recovers its target's PSYCHE."
msgstr "可恢复目标精神值的特殊弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00009f
msgid "Special ammo that recovers its target's LIFE."
msgstr "可恢复目标生命值的特殊弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a0
msgid "Special ammo that knocks its target unconscious. Hitting certain areas will quicken the effect."
msgstr "可使目标昏迷的特殊弹药。击中特定部位可加快生效。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a1
msgid "Omnidirectional sensor that visualizes nearby sounds as waveforms. The \"N\" icon points north."
msgstr "全向传感器，将附近声音以波形显示。\"N\"图标指向北方。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a2
msgid "Omnidirectional sensor that visualizes nearby sounds as waveforms. The \"N\" icon points north. Modified to show precise enemy locations."
msgstr "全向传感器，将附近声音以波形显示。\"N\"图标指向北方。经改造可显示敌人精确位置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a3
msgid "High-power sensor that displays surrounding topography and enemy positions. Only functional in Normal Phase."
msgstr "高性能传感器，可显示周围地形与敌人位置。仅在普通阶段有效。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a4
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a5
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a6
msgid "High-power sensor that displays surrounding topography and enemy positions. Only functional in Normal Phase. Modified to extend battery life."
msgstr "高性能传感器，可显示周围地形与敌人位置。仅在普通阶段有效。经改造延长了电池寿命。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a7
msgid "High-power sensor that displays surrounding topography and enemy positions. Only functional in Normal Phase. Modified to consume virtually no battery power at all."
msgstr "高性能传感器，可显示周围地形与敌人位置。仅在普通阶段有效。经改造几乎不消耗电池。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a8
msgid "Sensor that displays nearby sound sources as animated symbols. Not affected by surrounding objects. A prototype, it will only work when lying down or against a wall."
msgstr "将附近声源以动画符号显示的传感器。不受周围物体影响。为试制品，仅在卧倒或靠墙时有效。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000a9
msgid "Sensor that displays nearby sound sources as animated symbols. Symbols are displayed regardless of body position."
msgstr "将附近声源以动画符号显示的传感器。无论身体姿势如何都会显示符号。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000aa
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ab
msgid "Sensor that displays nearby sound sources as animated symbols. Modified to extend battery life."
msgstr "将附近声源以动画符号显示的传感器。经改造延长了电池寿命。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ac
msgid "Sensor that displays nearby sound sources as animated symbols. Modified to consume virtually no battery power at all."
msgstr "将附近声源以动画符号显示的传感器。经改造几乎不消耗电池。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ad
msgid "Citrus-flavored carbonated soft drink.  Recovers PSYCHE and a small amount of LIFE. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "柑橘味碳酸软饮料。恢复精神值与少量生命值。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ae
msgid "Zero-calorie carbonated soft drink.  Recovers PSYCHE and a small amount of LIFE. Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "零卡路里碳酸软饮料。恢复精神值与少量生命值。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000af
msgid "Tasty taco-flavored tortilla chips. Recovers LIFE.  Automatically used if LIFE reaches zero when equipped."
msgstr "美味的塔可味玉米片。恢复生命值。装备时生命值归零会自动使用。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b0
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b1
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b2
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b3
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b4
msgid "Cardboard box that explodes if damaged or if someone tries to see what's inside. Will inflict damage if you are inside. \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "受损或有人试图查看内部时会爆炸的纸箱。你在里面时会受到伤害。按\"DROP\"设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b5
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b6
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b7
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b8
msgid "Cardboard box that explodes and stuns anyone nearby if damaged or if someone tries to see what's inside. Will inflict damage if you are inside. \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "受损或有人试图查看内部时会爆炸并震晕附近人员的纸箱。你在里面时会受到伤害。按\"DROP\"设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000b9
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ba
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000bb
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000bc
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000bd
msgid "Cardboard box that explodes and releases smoke if damaged or if someone tries to see what's inside. Will inflict damage if you are inside. \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "受损或有人试图查看内部时会爆炸并释放烟雾的纸箱。你在里面时会受到伤害。按\"DROP\"设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000be
msgid "Cardboard box made of straw. Allows you to pull enemies inside, knock them out, and perform a Fulton recovery."
msgstr "稻草制成的纸箱。可将敌人拉入其中，使其昏迷并进行富尔顿回收。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000bf
msgid "Special box that speeds your LIFE recovery when you are inside or a teammate's when giving CPR.   \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "特殊纸箱，你在里面时或对队友进行心肺复苏时可加快生命值恢复。按\"DROP\"设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c0
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c1
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c2
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c3
msgid "Special box that speeds your LIFE recovery when you are inside or a teammate's when giving CPR.R&D has increased LIFE recovery.   \"DROP\" to set."
msgstr "特殊纸箱，你在里面时或对队友进行心肺复苏时可加快生命值恢复。研发提升了生命值恢复量。按\"DROP\"设置。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c4
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c5
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c6
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c7
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c8
msgid "Undercooked Meal, Ready-to-Eat. An already unappetizing creation made worse by being undercooked. Recovers only a small amount of LIFE."
msgstr "没煮熟的即食口粮。本就难吃，没煮熟后更难吃。仅恢复少量生命值。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000c9
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000ca
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000cb
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000cc
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0000cd
msgid "Well-done Meal, Ready-to-Eat. Makes a revolting ration surprisingly delicious. Recovers more LIFE than normal, and also recovers PSYCHE."
msgstr "煮熟的即食口粮。让恶心的口粮变得出奇美味。恢复的生命值比普通更多，还能恢复精神值。"

