#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000163
msgid "Thick, large Tigrex fang used to tear its prey into pieces."
msgstr "撕碎猎物的粗大轰龙牙。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000164
msgid "Highly acidic liquid fired out by Gear Rex. Can be modified to form a powerful sticky solution."
msgstr "霸王喷出的强酸性液体。可改造为强力粘着液。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000165
msgid "Gear Rex's bodily fluids filtered to increase purity. Incredibly concentrated."
msgstr "霸王体液经过滤提纯。浓度极高。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000166
msgid "A distilled version of Gear Rex's filtered bodily fluids, increasing the concentration. Devastatingly concentrated."
msgstr "霸王滤液的蒸馏版，浓度进一步提升。浓度极其惊人。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000167
msgid "Simple Olive Drab fatigues, offering the basic level of defense, main weapon storage, ammo storage, and camo index."
msgstr "普通橄榄绿迷彩服，提供基础防御、主武器收纳、弹药收纳与迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000168
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000169
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016a
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016b
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016c
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016e
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00016f
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in environments of a similar color."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在相近颜色的环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000170
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in jungle environments."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在丛林环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000171
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000172
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index near water."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在水边提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000173
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in dirt or sand environments."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在泥土或沙地环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000174
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in rocky environments."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在岩石环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000175
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000176
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of wooden buildings."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在木造建筑较多的环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000177
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of concrete."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。在混凝土较多的环境中提升迷彩指数。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000178
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Said to raise camo index in a certain environment, but where remains a mystery."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变种。据说能在某种环境中提升迷彩指数，但地点成谜。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000179
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Slightly increases the diameter of the CO-OPS boundary line."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。略微扩大合作任务边界线直径。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017a
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Slightly increases gun performance."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。略微提升枪械性能。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017b
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Inspired by a legendary scout's camo of choice. Its look and scent forge a bond with nature, giving an extremely high camo index."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。灵感来自传奇侦察兵钟爱的迷彩。其外观与气味与自然融为一体，迷彩指数极高。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017c
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Sorely needing a wash, these fatigues are a weapon in their own right - one whiff is enough to knock out those unaccustomed to them."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。急需清洗，这身迷彩服本身就是武器——一股气味足以熏倒不习惯的人。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017d
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Grants the wearer Tigrex's powerful charging ability, allowing them to knock enemies out with a single roll."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。赋予穿戴者轰龙般强大的冲撞能力，一次翻滚即可撞倒敌人。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017e
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Adds Rathalos's Bind Voice ability to CO-OPS messages. Battle Cry can then stop enemies from moving!"
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。为合作任务讯息添加火龙的束缚之声能力。战吼可让敌人无法移动！"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00017f
msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Grants the wearer the ability to steal PSYCHE from enemies after grabbing them."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的变体。赋予穿戴者抓住敌人后窃取精神的能力。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000180
msgid "Special suit with a high camo index in many environments and during movement. Speeds LIFE recovery, but has less main weapon ammo storage. For true stealth soldiers."
msgstr "在多种环境和移动中都有高迷彩指数的特殊服装。加快生命值恢复，但主武器弹药携带量较少。为真正的潜行士兵打造。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000181
msgid "Special combat suit with high defense and main weapon and ammo storage. Provides a lower camo index, ideal for a mix of combat and solo sneaking."
msgstr "高防御、大主武器与弹药容量的特殊战斗服。迷彩指数较低，适合战斗与单人潜行兼顾。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000182
msgid "Battle Dress with bulletproof helmet. Further raises the already impressive defense of Battle Dress. Turns a soldier into a walking tank."
msgstr "带防弹头盔的战斗服。进一步提升本已出色的防御力。让士兵变成行走的坦克。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000183
msgid "Fatigues with low defense, camo index, and main weapon ammo storage, but high movement speed. Good for players who like raw, intense combat."
msgstr "防御、迷彩指数和主武器弹药携带量都低，但移动速度快的迷彩服。适合喜欢纯粹激烈战斗的玩家。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000184
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000185
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000186
