#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000189
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018a
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018b
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in environments of a similar color, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在相近颜色的环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018c
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in jungle environments, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在丛林环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018d
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018e
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index near water, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在水边提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x00018f
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in dirt or sand environments, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在泥土或沙地环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000190
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in rocky environments, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在岩石环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000191
#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000192
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of wooden buildings, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在木制建筑较多的环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000193
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index in environments with a lot of concrete, but only half as much as full-body camo."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。在混凝土较多的环境中提升迷彩指数，但只有全身迷彩的一半。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000194
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Said to raise camo index in a certain environment, but where remains a mystery."
msgstr "裸装加迷彩裤的变体。据说能在某种环境中提升迷彩指数，但具体是哪里仍是个谜。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000195
msgid "A tuxedo. Though not exactly suited for combat missions, you're sure to be the best-dressed. Very low camo index."
msgstr "一套燕尾服。虽不太适合战斗任务，但你绝对是最讲究的。迷彩指数极低。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000196
msgid "Same fatigues as Miller. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues, but LIFE recovery and movement speed are slightly higher. For men only."
msgstr "与米勒相同的迷彩服。基本特性与丛林迷彩服相同，但生命值恢复和移动速度略高。仅限男性。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000197
msgid "Same fatigues as Amanda. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues, but LIFE recovery and movement speed are slightly higher. For women only."
msgstr "与阿曼达相同的迷彩服。基本特性与丛林迷彩服相同，但生命值恢复和移动速度略高。仅限女性。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000198
msgid "Male bathing suit. Possesses lowest attack and defense. Why anyone would wear these on a battlefield is a mystery. The only benefit is faster movement speed."
msgstr "男性泳装。攻击和防御最低。为何有人会穿它上战场是个谜。唯一好处是移动速度更快。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x000199
msgid "Female bathing suit. Possesses lowest attack and defense. Why anyone would wear this on a battlefield is a mystery. The only benefit is faster movement speed."
msgstr "女性泳装。攻击和防御最低。为何有人会穿它上战场是个谜。唯一好处是移动速度更快。"

