msgid "Variation of Jungle Fatigues camouflage. Raises camo index slightly when standing on jungle or dirt surfaces."
msgstr "丛林迷彩服的迷彩变体。站在丛林或泥土地面时迷彩指数略微提升。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001af
msgid "Original t-shirt design. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues. WALKMAN fans, show your support!"
msgstr "原创T恤设计。基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。WALKMAN粉丝，亮出你的支持！"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b0
msgid "Variation of Naked with camouflage pants. Raises camo index when standing on jungle or dirt surfaces, but only half as much as full-body camo."
