#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b3
msgid "T-shirt with the FOX insignia. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues. Become an honorary member of the legendary Special Forces unit!"
msgstr "印有FOX徽章的T恤。基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。成为传奇特种部队的荣誉成员！"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b4
msgid "Uniform of Russian commandos who participated in the operation to take control of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua. Same as Jungle Fatigues in defense and weapon storage. (VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "参与夺取尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地行动的苏联突击队制服。防御与武器收纳同丛林迷彩服。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b5
msgid "Uniform of Russian soldiers who participated in the operation to take control of the U.S. Missile Base in Nicaragua. Same as Jungle Fatigues in defense and weapon storage. (VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "参与夺取尼加拉瓜美军导弹基地行动的苏联士兵制服。防御与武器收纳同丛林迷彩服。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b6
msgid "Uniform of CIA mercenaries from scout missions. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "执行侦察任务的CIA雇佣兵制服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b7
msgid "Uniform of CIA mercenaries who participated in the base security missions in Costa Rica. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "参与哥斯达黎加基地警备任务的CIA雇佣兵制服。防御与武器收纳同丛林迷彩服。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b8
msgid "Equipment of CIA mercenaries from assault missions. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "执行强袭任务的CIA雇佣兵装备。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001b9
msgid "Prison uniform worn by freed male prisoners. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "获释男囚犯所穿的囚服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001ba
msgid "Uniform of CIA mercenaries who participated in the field patrol missions in Costa Rica. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "参与哥斯达黎加野外巡逻任务的CIA雇佣兵制服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001bb
msgid "Prison uniform worn by freed female prisoners. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage.(VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "获释女囚犯所穿的囚服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001bc
msgid "Uniform of mechanics who worked at the AI Weapon Hangar in Nicaragua. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage. (VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "在尼加拉瓜AI兵器机库工作的机械师制服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001bd
msgid "Uniform of CIA mercenaries who accompanied attack chopper and ground vehicles. Identical to Jungle Fatigues in basic characteristics such as defense and weapon storage. (VERSUS OPS Only)"
msgstr "随攻击直升机与地面车辆行动的CIA雇佣兵制服。防御、武器收纳等基本性能与丛林迷彩服相同。（仅限对战任务）"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001be
msgid "Small-caliber armor-piercing assault rifle ammo."
msgstr "小口径穿甲突击步枪弹药。"

#: slot/0x0056a63d/0x048941/0x0001bf
